# A `debug_assert!` with no contract (the pop's schedule is a protocol
# between the fast pop and the slow path that no specification states).
debug_scheduled	panic/abort	Kani
# Trusted: a reference-to-pointer conversion; a well-formed `Shared` is
# the one at `Shared::storage`, the only place one is built in the shipped
# library. False under `cfg(test)`, where the unit tests build others.
shared_ptr	allocator invariant	none (assumption)
# Temporary seams, discharged by lane 51b-3 (the heap entry points), which
# verifies `free_fast_slot`, `alloc`, `alloc_declined`, `alloc_zeroed` and
# `free` against these contracts.
free_fast_slot	allocator invariant	Verus
alloc	allocator invariant	Verus
alloc_declined	allocator invariant	Verus
alloc_zeroed	allocator invariant	Verus
free	allocator invariant	Verus
